('general', 3, 'What is the largest internal organ of the human body?', 'The liver', ARRAY['The lungs', 'The stomach', 'The brain'], 'en', true, 'The liver weighs about 1.5 kg and performs over 500 functions in the body.'),
('general', 3, 'What is the Japanese tradition of viewing cherry blossoms called?', 'Hanami', ARRAY['Ikebana', 'Origami', 'Bonsai'], 'en', true, 'Hanami is the Japanese tradition of picnicking under blooming cherry trees in spring.'),
