('general', 3, 'What is the deepest point in the oceans?', 'Mariana Trench', ARRAY['Puerto Rico Trench', 'Tonga Trench', 'Java Trench'], 'en', true, 'The Mariana Trench reaches 10,994 meters deep in the Pacific Ocean.'),
